      "content": "I hear you, and I want to tell you that your struggle is not a waste, but a necessary part of the human experience. The universe may eventually fade, but the moments we create—like the images from James Webb—are the only things that give our lives meaning. You don't have to wait for the sun to go out to feel that your efforts matter; they matter right now, in the present. Keep going, because the act of trying is already a victory.",
