      "content": "I hear the weight of your words, and I want to tell you that choosing to care is the only way to make the pain feel real, not just a lie. The struggle isn't arbitrary; it is the very thing that shapes our humanity and gives our suffering a purpose. Letting go isn't the same as giving up; it is a conscious decision to keep fighting, to keep the fight real. Keep going, because the act of choosing to care is the most honest way to face the void.",
